{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55660","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十八 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"养性摅情不记年，免寻云水更参禅。\n有心用处还应错，无意看时却宛然。\n析法尚嫌灰断果，烧丹堪愍地行仙。\n欲知此理谁人会，水自朝东月自圆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55660.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55660","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}